## Lessons

1. Use `npx shadcn@latest add [component]` instead of `npx shadcn-ui@latest add [component]` when installing Shadcn UI components.
2. In Next.js 14+, page props params must be typed as a Promise. Example:
   ```typescript
   type tParams = Promise<{ id: string }>
   interface PageProps {
     params: tParams
   }
   ```
   Then await the params in the component:
   ```typescript
   export default async function Page(props: PageProps) {
     const { id } = await props.params
   }
   ```
3. Use `const session = await auth()` instead of `const session = await getServerSession(authOptions)` for Next.js authentication. The new `auth()` function is the recommended way to get the session in Next.js Auth v5.
4. When importing `useRouter` from 'next/navigation', the component must be marked as a client component using the `'use client'` directive at the top of the file, as this hook only works on the client side.
5. Every Client Component that uses hooks must start with `'use client'`. Never put async/await at the top level of a Client Component — use Server Components for data fetching.
6. Prisma Client must be instantiated as a singleton to avoid connection exhaustion in dev:
   ```typescript
   // lib/prisma.ts
   import { PrismaClient } from '@prisma/client'
   const globalForPrisma = globalThis as unknown as { prisma: PrismaClient }
   export const prisma = globalForPrisma.prisma ?? new PrismaClient()
   if (process.env.NODE_ENV !== 'production') globalForPrisma.prisma = prisma
   ```
7. All Stripe webhook handlers must use `req.text()` for raw body parsing — never `req.json()`.
8. `next/image` requires `remotePatterns` in next.config.js for all external image domains (Unsplash, Cloudinary, UploadThing, etc.).
9. Zustand stores must use `immer` middleware for complex state or spread explicitly. Never mutate state directly.
10. All form submissions use React Hook Form + Zod schema validation. Never use uncontrolled raw HTML forms.
11. Framer Motion `useScroll` and `useTransform` only work in Client Components. Keep layout.tsx as a Server Component and wrap animated sections in separate `'use client'` components.
12. For Lenis smooth scroll: initialize in a `<LenisProvider>` client component that wraps children in layout.tsx.
13. `searchParams` in page.tsx are also typed as a Promise in Next.js 14+:
    ```typescript
    type tSearchParams = Promise<{ [key: string]: string | string[] | undefined }>
    ```
14. Never import a Client Component into a Server Component that fetches data — always pass data down as props from Server to Client.
15. Use `@/` path alias for all imports. Never use relative `../../` paths.

