## What Never To Do

- Never use `<form action="">` — use Server Action or React Hook Form.
- Never call `prisma` in a Client Component.
- Never expose environment variable values in client-side code.
- Never use `JSON.parse` without try/catch.
- Never use `as any`.
- Never skip Zod validation on user input.
- Never create a Prisma Client outside `lib/prisma.ts`.
- Never use `fetch` in a Client Component for mutations — use Server Actions.
- Never leave `console.log` in committed code.
- Never use relative `../../` imports — always `@/`.

