## Stripe Integration

- Use `stripe.checkout.sessions.create()` — do not build custom payment UI.
- Webhook at `/api/webhooks/stripe`:
  - `checkout.session.completed` → create Order, decrement stock, clear cart, send email
  - `payment_intent.payment_failed` → update order status
- Always verify signature: `stripe.webhooks.constructEvent()`
- Store `stripePaymentId` on Order.
- lib/stripe.ts — singleton, same pattern as lib/prisma.ts.

